    {
      "index": 8,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "As a very old boss, Kalphite Queen is relatively unrewarding and relatively simple. Typically only done for the pet or collection log, there is no further reason for a high level account to do this boss. The only notable mechanic is her form change. She will spawn into the instance immune to  and . After the first 40k damage is dealt, she will change forms to her flying form, which is immune to . More information available here: https://runescape.wiki/w/Kalphite_Queen",
      "location": {
        "start": 161560,
        "end": 162436
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
